+/*
+ * Input boost (patch 0217). sweet_gpu_input_boost() is called by the touch thread (through sweet_input_boost(), at most
+ * every ~10 ms) and only stores the hold deadline (now + sweetgpuinputms): the DCVS vote needs the GPU lock and an OOB handshake with the GMU, so
